+# Existing original-record tasks — exact records next
+
+October30,2026. Existing B129 /PD01–PD04 /FAA01–FAA04 /REC03. No new competing master register or changed substantive acceptance criteria.
+
+| Task | Existing-record retrieval target | Discriminating outcome and limit |
+|---|---|---|
+| PD01 / FAA01–02 | Native Request2division response, its review comments/approval, actual outgoing transmittal, enclosure manifest and recipient acknowledgment; office/version/routing crosswalk for catalogAAT-20andheadingAAT-200. | Establish what version/items were actually dispatched and received. The provided-language and a review request do not prove final approval, completeness or correction. |
+| PD01 / REC03 | The five Item16certified rerecordings and four full transcripts, complete certification sheets, original tape/channel/copy identifiers, generation logs and precise start/end/counter rules. Include the New York Operations Manager and both TMU starts, plus the matching Boston Military Operations Specialist pair. | Test whether matched original media actually correspond, and whether printed end differences persist. Same labels/roles do not authenticate identical channels or clocks. Preserve any inconsistent values. |
+| PD01 / REC03 | Item16logs/Notifications-to-Military sheet and cross-referenced Item20materials, including any additional segments, full accident-file vs accident-package inventories and delivery version history. | A complete item-level accounting could weaken or substantiate a coverage concern. Do not infer missing audio from this sub-list or sum differences across channels. |
+| PD01 / REC03 | The actual Cleveland chain-of-custody memorandum and SATORI list named on physical26, with original acquisition/transfer references and source reconstruction inputs. | A listing is not the custody instrument or native radar output. Reuse already held originals if a verified match is found; do not count copies as independent corroboration. |
+| PD01–PD04 / FAA01–04 | Actual May2003draft/transmission/clarification/corrected answer and delivery; signed consideration/action/no-action with reasons; separate recommendation implementation and closure; governing policy and case-specific applicability. | None is completed by finding this request/response. Keep original answer, later correction, investigation closure, recommendation resolution and personnel outcome separate. |
+
+Untested alternatives for the time labels include minute precision, indexing/assembly conventions, separate channels/copies, other enclosure segments or an actual difference in media coverage. No alternative is selected. Obtain actual matched media and definitions before any audio or historical-clock inference; coordinate substantive decoding/alignment with its technical owner rather than duplicating it here.
+
+Missing telephone carrier/native-field/call-leg roots, authenticated recorder inputs/configuration and clocks, materials specimens/native calibration/same-specimen joins, and steel preservation/native inventory/attribution/review-delivery records remain open. A page not yet read remains unread, not evidence of absence. Revisit on a specific new original/link or applicable completed result; do not repeat the exact completed queries or unchanged SSH failure. No outreach, new request, fee, mailbox or filing is authorized by this queue.
